  "description": "This dataset contains the location and attendance information for the NYC Parks Swim For Life program, an instructional swimming program which serves second grade public school students in NYC. The program runs during the school year, starting in October and concluding in June. This dataset contains Swim for Life program information from 2022 onwards.\n\nExplore the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1SSicOpPqkUnCr58QlmRPP8p--hY5zRZi40Zsq1k4vXs/edit?usp=sharing\">Data Dictionary</a>\n\nView Open Data for Swim for Life data (2016 to 2020): <a href=\"https://data.cityofnewyork.us/Recreation/Swim-for-Life/mtt6-ywt4/about_data\">here</a>\n\nLearn more about this program on the NYC Parks website: <a href=\"https://www.nycgovparks.org/opportunities/support/swim-for-life\">Swim For Life</a>\n\nNote: Swim for Life program was on pause due to COVID-19 pandemic. The program resumed Spring 2022.",
